lavender-minimal 1101: XR (828x1792 @2x) on the first lavender kernel's copy path - frames are copied
into the boot framebuffer at 828x1792 (stride 3328) and the source pipe VIG0 that ABL left scanning
it fetches that size; its QSEED3 scales to the 1080x2340 panel (rewritten from 0995/1028/1031 without
the MDP flip, GPU pool or direct-present changes). Touches over the whole panel. boot-arg
sweetfb_xr=1 or sweetfb_scale2=2; ADT mkadt_lavender.py --xr --scale2.

